## vendor/xenova-transformers/

Portions of Transformers.js (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js),
Copyright (c) Xenova and the Transformers.js contributors.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full licence text is at
vendor/xenova-transformers/LICENSE and at
http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

These files are vendored (copied into this repository) rather than installed
as an npm dependency, so that Chamber's runtime has no package dependencies.
That choice makes them invisible to `npm audit`, Dependabot, and SBOM tooling
— see vendor/xenova-transformers/VERSION for the pinned upstream revision and
integrity hashes. Redistribution of this repository redistributes these files
under Apache-2.0.

